        "content": "<p>alexcrichton opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14736\">PR #14736</a> from <code>alexcrichton:assert-to-ensure</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>If an earlier error leaves the store in an inconsistent state such that <code>suspend_reason</code> is unexpected <code>Some(_)</code>, return an error instead of panicking.</p>\n<p>Future improvement: check for a poisoned store at all public API entrypoints so that we can catch this type of thing earlier and more consistently.</p>\n<p>part of <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/security/advisories/GHSA-hmwq-g22x-qjw5\">https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/security/advisories/GHSA-hmwq-g22x-qjw5</a></p>\n</blockquote>",
